cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HISS-RAT: Hotel Information Security Risk Assessment Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Thiyagarajan"
    given-names: "Raghunath"
    affiliation: "REVA University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raghunath-thiyagarajan/hiss-rat"
license: MIT
abstract: "A Python standard library toolkit that parses Nessus HTML exports, scores systems by finding severity and role criticality, estimates downtime impact with an explicit assumption model, maps finding families to ISO/IEC 27001:2022, PCI DSS and GDPR and tests ranking stability. The repository holds synthetic sample data only."
keywords:
  - cyber security
  - risk assessment
  - vulnerability scanning
  - hospitality
